{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.1778772993735","title":"Effective Rust development is a design transformation, not syntax mastery","desc":"Mahir syntax Rust belum cukup; efekifitas Rust tercapai ketika cara desain software berubah.","updated":1778773151626,"created":1778773030521,"tags":["zettel","rust","design","learning"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.1778772993735","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"3168b7bdde98cade4084aebdccf1453e","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1778772993735","id":"zettel.1778772993735","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1778772993735","id":"zettel.1778772993735","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.rust","alias":"rust","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.rust"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1778772993735","id":"zettel.1778772993735","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.design","alias":"design","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.design"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1778772993735","id":"zettel.1778772993735","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.learning","alias":"learning","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.learning"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1778772993735","id":"zettel.1778772993735","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.literature.design-patterns-and-best-practices-in-rust","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":3,"offset":576},"end":{"line":18,"column":67,"offset":640},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.literature.design-patterns-and-best-practices-in-rust"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.moc.software-architecture","id":"zettel.moc.software-architecture","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":3,"offset":2358},"end":{"line":41,"column":27,"offset":2382},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1778772993735"}],"anchors":{"klaim":{"type":"header","text":"Klaim","value":"klaim","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"bukti":{"type":"header","text":"Bukti","value":"bukti","line":19,"column":0,"depth":2},"implikasi":{"type":"header","text":"Implikasi","value":"implikasi","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2},"hubungan":{"type":"header","text":"Hubungan","value":"hubungan","line":29,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"effective-rust-development-is-a-design-transformation-not-syntax-mastery\">Effective Rust development is a design transformation, not syntax mastery<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#effective-rust-development-is-a-design-transformation-not-syntax-mastery\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"klaim\">Klaim<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#klaim\"></a></h2>\n<p>Menguasai syntax Rust tidak sama dengan menguasai desain Rust. Yang dibutuhkan adalah transformasi cara berpikir tentang software.</p>\n<h2 id=\"bukti\">Bukti<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#bukti\"></a></h2>\n<p>Preface menyatakan bahwa efektifitas Rust berasal dari internalisasi filosofi Rust, bukan dari teknik atau pola individu.</p>\n<h2 id=\"implikasi\">Implikasi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#implikasi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kurva belajar Rust bukan hanya tentang <code>struct</code>, <code>trait</code>, atau <code>Result</code>.</li>\n<li>Fokus pembelajaran harus bergeser ke cara mendesain relasi antar komponen, ownership boundary, dan invariants.</li>\n<li>Buku yang baik akan menampilkan failure mode sebelum menunjukkan best practice.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"hubungan\">Hubungan<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#hubungan\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.design-patterns-and-best-practices-in-rust\">Rust-native design lebih dari sekadar pattern</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">rust (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">design (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">learning (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.software-architecture\">MOC: Software Architecture</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaultWikiLink":false,"enableRemoteVaultInit":true,"enableUserTags":true,"enableHashTags":true,"workspaceVaultSync